      "id": "claim_0f8d3e2f9bec4443a6bb13989fda5a6d",
      "statement": "The `/search` client page loads conversation summaries on mount, loads messages for a selected conversation, submits a trimmed prompt with an optional active conversation ID to `POST /api/chat/search`, and appends the server-returned saved messages; a new-chat action only resets client state.",
