      "id": "claim_6176b7c7ab3c4bfd990b3d7aada6e5ef",
      "statement": "Agent invocation errors are caught and converted into a fixed fallback assistant message that is persisted, whereas errors outside that inner invocation block return HTTP 500; because the user write precedes invocation and there is no transaction, a failed later step can leave a partial turn.",
